  (text "Reset outputs tolerate target pull-ups without sourcing\nvoltage into an unpowered target. Maximum target sink\ncurrent allocation: 1mA; verify low threshold with exact load.\n\nMODEM_OFF_N connects to FULL_CARD_POWER_OFF# only\nwith a switched target-rail pull-up. Without that pull-up,\nthe module remains off. Do not drive from an always-on rail.\n\nThis circuit does not implement modem power switching,\nPoE, USB forwarding, Ethernet or SIM. See architecture gate." (at 228.6 162.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "d90b2e1b-d6ce-50a5-8b0f-081f18026456"))
